aced, collaborative environment. -Willingness to participate in continuing medical education and professional development activities. Benefits: -Very competitive overhead offered: 23% (no HST) - Incentive of $5000 sign-on bonus for 1-year term with additional retention bonuses annually. Please inquire for more details. -Opportunity to work in a new, modern medical centre complete with full staff breakroom with coffee and snacks - Opportunity to form a FHG with option to transition to FHO+ -Supportive work environment Regal Heights Medical Centre is an equal opportunity employer and welcomes applicants from diverse backgrounds. We thank all applicants for their interest; however, only those selected for an interview will be contacted. Join us in making a difference in the lives of our patients and community! We look forward to welcoming you to our team at Regal Heights Medical Centre.","datePosted":"2026-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","validThrough":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","hiringOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Regal Heights Medical Centre"},"employmentType":"full-time","jobLocation":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"1086 St. Clair Ave W","addressLocality":"Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","postalCode":"M6E1A7","addressCountry":"CA"}},"identifier":{"@type":"PropertyValue","value":"6aa4df535ffbbbfeb637f666"}}'::jsonb, '2026-10-04T05:13:30.777Z'
)
