  '6a9118b65ffbbbfeb613d47a', 'https://physiciancareers.ca/jobs/family-physician-16-18-overhead-fhgfho-pathway-available-primary-care-6a9118b65ffbbbfeb613d47a', 'Family Physician (16-18% Overhead, FHG/FHO+ Pathway available) - Primary Care', 'Family Medicine', 'full-time', 'Aegis Clinical', 'downtown toronto', 'ON', '436 Dundas Street West', 'Old Toronto, ON', 43.6532, -79.3832, 0, NULL, 'annual', 400000, 600000, 500000, 500000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, NULL, '2026-09-11', '2026-12-10', '2026-12-10', '2026-12-10', FALSE, '["hq@aegisclinic.ca"]'::jsonb, '', 'Family Physician, Comprehensive Primary Care Aegis Clinical, 436 Dundas St W, Toronto (Chinatown / Kensington) We&#39;re Aegis Clinical in downtown Toronto, Toronto&#39;s highest-rated multidisciplinary clinic at 4.9 stars on Google. We serve a diverse downtown community with family medicine and other medical services, with care available in English, Mandarin, and other diverse languages. We are seeking family physicians to deliver comprehensive primary care, we can accommodate flexible scheduling. Why Aegis 16-18% ultra-competitive overhead. Billing, staffing, rooming, vitals, and marketing are all covered. No hidden fees, we will take care of everything so you can focus on seeing patients. Patients from day one. One of our physicians is relocating to the US, so an existing roster is available for takeover. Bill from a full schedule immediately, or build your own panel with our patient demand behind you. Exceptional reputation. Rated 4.9 stars on Google, Aegis has a strong and established standing in our local community. Concrete plan to obtain FHO+ . We are forming a physician group to transition to the enrolment model, with a defined pathway and timeline. Join now and you&#39;re a founding member shaping the group, not a late addition to someone else&#39;s structure. Flexible Scheduling : Flexible arrangements including part-time so you can keep your current practice and patients. The practice Fully flexible schedule, full-time or part-time, with complete clinical autonomy. Accuro EMR. Expected earnings of CA$400,000 to $600,000 for a full time role, depending on panel size and volume. Requirements CPSO independent practice licence and OHIP billing eligibility. CCFP or eligibility. Interest in practising within a collaborative FHO or FHG group. Mandarin or Cantonese not required. Apply Send your resume to hq@aegisclinic.ca to discuss the opportunity or arrange a clinic tour. Informal conversations welcome.', '{}'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"JobPosting","title":"Family Physician (16-18% Overhead, FHG/FHO+ Pathway available) - Primary Care","description":"Family Physician, Comprehensive Primary Care Aegis Clinical, 436 Dundas St W, Toronto (Chinatown / Kensington) We&#39;re Aegis Clinical in downtown Toronto, Toronto&#39;s highest-rated multidisciplinary clinic at 4.9 stars on Google. We serve a diverse downtown community with family medicine and other medical services, with care available in English, Mandarin, and other diverse languages. We are seeking family physicians to deliver comprehensive primary care, we can accommodate flexible scheduling. Why Aegis 16-18% ultra-competitive overhead. Billing, staffing, rooming, vitals, and marketing are all covered. No hidden fees, we will take care of everything so you can focus on seeing patients. Patients from day one. One of our physicians is relocating to the US, so an existing roster is available for takeover. Bill from a full schedule immediately, or build your own panel with our patient demand behind you. Exceptional reputation. Rated 4.9 stars on Google, Aegis has a strong and established standing in our local community. Concrete plan to obtain FHO+ . We are forming a physician group to transition to the enrolment model, with a defined pathway and timeline. Join now and you&#39;re a founding member shaping the group, not a late addition to someone else&#39;s structure. Flexible Scheduling : Flexible arrangements including part-time so you can keep your current practice and patients. The practice Fully flexible schedule, full-time or part-time, with complete clinical autonomy. Accuro EMR. Expected earnings of CA$400,000 to $600,000 for a full time role, depending on panel size and volume. Requirements CPSO independent practice licence and OHIP billing eligibility. CCFP or eligibility. Interest in practising within a collaborative FHO or FHG group. Mandarin or Cantonese not required. Apply Send your resume to hq@aegisclinic.ca to discuss the opportunity or arrange a clinic tour. Informal conversations welcome.","datePosted":"2026-09-11T00:00:00.000Z","validThrough":"2026-12-10T00:00:00.000Z","hiringOrganization":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Aegis Clinical"},"employmentType":"full-time","jobLocation":{"@type":"Place","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"436 Dundas Street West","addressLocality":"Old Toronto","addressRegion":"ON","postalCode":"M5T 1G7","addressCountry":"CA"}},"identifier":{"@type":"PropertyValue","value":"6a9118b65ffbbbfeb613d47a"}}'::jsonb, '2026-10-04T05:13:33.665Z'
)
